window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-3903992afce071c2"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"integrated-terminal\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">集成终端</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在页面 URL 后追加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该文档的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>ChatGPT 桌面应用中的每个对话，都有一个作用范围限定在当前项目或 worktree 内的终端。选择 <strong>New tab（新建标签页）</strong>，再选择 <strong>Terminal（终端）</strong>，也可以按 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>`</kbd>。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：集成终端抽屉在 ChatGPT 对话下方打开</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"run-and-validate-your-project\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">运行并验证项目</h2> <p>无需切换应用，就可以在终端中验证修改、运行脚本和执行 Git 操作。ChatGPT 可以读取当前终端输出，因此在你工作时，它可以检查正在运行的开发服务器，或参考失败的构建信息。</p> <p>常用命令包括：</p> <ul> <li><code>git status</code></li> <li><code>git pull --rebase</code></li> <li><code>pnpm test</code> 或 <code>npm test</code></li> <li><code>pnpm run lint</code> 或其他项目指定的检查命令</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"create-reusable-actions\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">创建可重复使用的操作</h2> <p>如果经常运行某个命令，可以在<a href=\"#/article/a-86cde8be2e24d05a?anchor=actions\">本地环境</a>中为它定义一个操作。操作会在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中显示为快捷方式，并在集成终端中运行。</p> <p><kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>K</kbd> 会打开应用命令面板，不会清空终端。要清空终端，请按 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>L</kbd>。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"integrated-terminal\">Integrated terminal</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Each chat in the ChatGPT desktop app includes a terminal scoped to its current project or worktree. Select <strong>New tab</strong>, then <strong>Terminal</strong>, or press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>`</kbd>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Integrated terminal drawer open beneath a ChatGPT chat</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"run-and-validate-your-project\">Run and validate your project</h2> <p>Use the terminal to validate changes, run scripts, and perform Git operations without switching apps. ChatGPT can read the current terminal output, so it can check a running development server or refer to a failed build while it works with you.</p> <p>Common commands include:</p> <ul> <li><code>git status</code></li> <li><code>git pull --rebase</code></li> <li><code>pnpm test</code> or <code>npm test</code></li> <li><code>pnpm run lint</code> or another project-specific check</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"create-reusable-actions\">Create reusable actions</h2> <p>If you run a command regularly, define an action in your <a href=\"#/article/a-86cde8be2e24d05a?anchor=actions\">local environment</a>. Actions appear as shortcuts in the ChatGPT desktop app and run in the integrated terminal.</p> <p><kbd>Cmd</kbd>+<kbd>K</kbd> opens the app command palette; it doesn't clear the terminal. To clear the terminal, press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>L</kbd>.</p>"};
